canon subject status: uncovered-cell checkout.pay — verifying → shipped: feature surface `checkout.pay` (root `root`) has no `@case:failure` scenario among its 2 in-scope scenario(s) — its spec covers only other paths; specify what happens on that path
canon subject status: unreviewed-promotion checkout — verifying → shipped: brief not approved — checkout adopts no change to carry the brief; write one with `canon change new <slug> --subject checkout --title "<title>"`; a human must answer the brief, and the agent records `Approved: <who> <when> — "<their words>"` in its proposal.md only from that answer
